{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43161","headline":"登阁 · 李士元","name":"登阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱後独来登大阁，凭阑举目尽伤心。\n长堤过雨人行少，废苑经秋草自深。\n破落侯家通永巷，萧条宫树接疎林。\n总输释氏青莲馆，依旧重重布地金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}